[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p>Drain the coolant (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025386\">5010B45</a> (left and\nright sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025389\">5010B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025805\">7040A95</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a> (left side)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025480\">5505A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025431\">5040C10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections for the motors (1a, 1b,\n1c, 1d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Left air mixture flap actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024536\">N78</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Air distribution actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024540\">N80</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Right air mixture flap actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024538\">N79</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Air intake actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024545\">N82</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections of the sensors (2a, 2b,\n2c, 2d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Upper treated air sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024344\">K88A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Upper treated air sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024345\">K88B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Lower treated air sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024341\">K87A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2d</p></td><td><p>Lower treated air sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024342\">K87B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b, 3c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Passenger compartment ventilation fan</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024548\">N85</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Fan speed&#x27; variator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024460\">M72A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3c</p></td><td><p>Fan speed&#x27; variator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024462\">M72B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the electrical connections of the additional heater\n(4a, 4b, 4c) (JTD version only).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4a</p></td><td><p>Additional heater resistor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024568\">O25A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4b</p></td><td><p>Additional heater resistor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024570\">O25B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4c</p></td><td><p>Additional heater resistor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024572\">O25C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Release the base with relay (JTD version only).</p><p>6. Disconnect the wiring harness retaining collars.</p><p>7. Remove the wiring harness assembly.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004841.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the cable loom.</p><p>Engage the base with relay.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Secure the wiring harness using retaining\nclips.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025431\">5040C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025480\">5505A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a> (left side)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025805\">7040A95</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025389\">5010B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025386\">5010B45</a> (left and\nright sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3025796\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025612\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025391\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025403\">5010D56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025591\">5560B56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025590\">5560B11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025570\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025799\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025282\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025802\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025613\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025444\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025597\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025804\">7040A80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025833\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025278\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025803\">7040A65</a> (left\nand right sides)</p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3024826\">1048A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p>"]]